--   Theme         - decoration style BaseManager.decorateLane applies around the dig
--                   site (e.g. "Forest" => trees flanking the lane). Zone 1 ("The
--                   Burrow") is the home/plot area and has NO theme decorations.
--
-- DIG ODDS are NO LONGER hand-written per zone — they are GENERATED by ZoneConfig.digOdds(zone)
-- (see the bottom of this file) so the rarity curve keeps making sense automatically as zones are
-- added. A zone may still hard-OVERRIDE its odds by setting an explicit `DigOdds` table on its entry.
--
-- NOTE: income is no longer scaled by zone. CashScale/GemScale are KEPT for
-- reference but are UNUSED by income — the per-zone economy boost has been
-- REPLACED by the permanent, compounding rebirth multipliers (cash 1.35^rb)
-- applied in BrainrotMath. The fields remain so existing data / tooling that reads them keeps working.
--
-- To add a new zone: append an entry (no DigOdds needed — they're generated) and bump MaxZone.
-- Everything else (digging odds, economy, rebirth unlock chain, map building) reads from here.

